ЗАДАНИЕ 3. Флаги -q, -m, -t

 Флаг -m (кратность) 

$ ./prog3.out -m 10 5
→ 10 is a multiple of 5

$ ./prog3.out -m 10 3
→ 10 is not a multiple of 3

$ ./prog3.out -m -10 5
→ -10 is a multiple of 5

$ ./prog3.out -m 10 -5
→ 10 is a multiple of -5

$ ./prog3.out -m 7 7
→ 7 is a multiple of 7

$ ./prog3.out -m 0 5
→ Error: number out of range for this flag

$ ./prog3.out -m abc 5
→ Warning: <a> should be integer

$ ./prog3.out -m 10
→ Usage: ./prog3.out -m <a> <b>

 Флаг -t (прямоугольный треугольник) 

$ ./prog3.out -t 1e-6 3 4 5
→ right triangle

$ ./prog3.out -t 1e-6 5 3 4
→ right triangle

$ ./prog3.out -t 1e-6 1 1 1
→ not right triangle

$ ./prog3.out -t 1e-6 1 2 3
→ not right triangle

$ ./prog3.out -t 1e-6 -3 4 5
→ Error: number out of range for this flag

Флаг -q (квадратное уравнение, все перестановки) 

$ ./prog3.out -q 1e-6 1 -3 2
→ шесть уникальных троек:
   a = 1, b = -3, c = 2: x1 = 1, x2 = 2
   a = 1, b = 2, c = -3: x1 = -3, x2 = 1
   a = -3, b = 1, c = 2: x1 = -0.666667, x2 = 1
   a = -3, b = 2, c = 1: x1 = -0.333333, x2 = 1
   a = 2, b = 1, c = -3: x1 = -1.5, x2 = 1
   a = 2, b = -3, c = 1: x1 = 0.5, x2 = 1

$ ./prog3.out -q 1e-6 1 2 3
→ 6 перестановок, у всех: "no real roots"

$ ./prog3.out -q 1e-6 1 1 2
   a = 1, b = 1, c = 2: no real roots
   a = 1, b = 2, c = 1: x = -1
   a = 2, b = 1, c = 1: no real roots

$ ./prog3.out -q 1e-6 2 2 2
   a = 2, b = 2, c = 2: no real roots

